{"uid":"cc135e503af7768c","name":"test_the_midrun_episode_scoping_call_also_excludes_a_settled_obligation","fullName":"tests.test_confirmed_petition_not_resurfaced#test_the_midrun_episode_scoping_call_also_excludes_a_settled_obligation","historyId":"2f06a375f0c2da5a06c20ed8ce9870e7","time":{"start":1791958240221,"stop":1791958240224,"duration":3},"description":"`LoopSupervisor._maybe_run_midrun_adjudication_episode` scopes its\n    bounded, off-budget episode to `open_unconfirmed_petitions(workspace,\n    run, contract_text=..., tasks=...)` and returns immediately when that\n    list is empty. Called with the episode's own argument shape (the\n    `tasks` list is what engages `_obligation_is_history`, which is left\n    exactly as it is -- #212 says it is already too aggressive), so a\n    settled obligation costs no further episode either. The before/after\n    pair keeps this non-vacuous: the obligation IS open until it settles.","descriptionHtml":"<p><code>LoopSupervisor._maybe_run_midrun_adjudication_episode</code> scopes its<br />\nbounded, off-budget episode to <code>open_unconfirmed_petitions(workspace, run, contract_text=..., tasks=...)</code> and returns immediately when that<br />\nlist is empty. Called with the episode's own argument shape (the<br />\n<code>tasks</code> list is what engages <code>_obligation_is_history</code>, which is left<br />\nexactly as it is -- #212 says it is already too aggressive), so a<br />\nsettled obligation costs no further episode either. The before/after<br />\npair keeps this non-vacuous: the obligation IS open until it settles.</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1791957838565,"stop":1791957838565,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attach